{"id": "70522", "title": "异种岛", "author": "西陵冥", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 23, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70522/70522s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70522.htm", "intro": "属性分类：现代／东方奇幻／强攻强受／正剧\n    关键字：张曜 　裴晏 　其他\n    诡异的天气，突现的黑洞，造成飞机出事。\n    人们由此踏上神秘海岛，从未见过的生物逐渐浮现，\n    一同登岛的幸存者，在岛上为了生存显露人性最真实一面，\n    而恐怖的麻烦也接踵袭向他们。\n    张曜和岛上的‘野人’相识，一同搭档挑战各种诡异生物，\n    惊险的事一件接著一件。\n    这座岛，究竟是他们生存的希望，还是另一个可怕噩梦的开始？\n    喜欢强强，热爱恐怖刺激血腥历险类，\n    更爱各种恐怖物种出没和人性描写的，就请看进来吧！", "base": "files/article/html/70/70522", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "1-5", "file": "10997095.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10997096.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10997097.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10997098.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10997099.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10997100.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10997101.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10997102.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "10997103.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "10997104.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "10997105.html", "available": false}, {"title": "56-60", "file": "10997106.html", "available": true}, {"title": "61-65", "file": "10997107.html", "available": true}, {"title": "66-70", "file": "10997154.html", "available": true}, {"title": "71-75", "file": "10997155.html", "available": true}, {"title": "76-82", "file": "10997156.html", "available": true}, {"title": "83-87", "file": "10997157.html", "available": true}, {"title": "88-92", "file": "10997158.html", "available": true}, {"title": "93-96", "file": "10997159.html", "available": true}, {"title": "97-101", "file": "10997160.html", "available": true}, {"title": "102-106", "file": "10997161.html", "available": true}, {"title": "107-110", "file": "10997162.html", "avail